Ported files (original header kept, "Ported from" line added; each header lists what was kept and changed),
all under operaton-plugin-identity-scim/src/main/java/org/operaton/extensions/plugin/identityscim/:
- ScimIdentityProviderPlugin.java (from plugin/ScimIdentityProviderPlugin and ScimConfiguration: registration, properties)
- internal/ScimIdentityProviderSession.java (from ScimIdentityProviderReadOnly: provider contract, authorization rules)
- internal/ScimDirectory.java (from ScimIdentityProviderReadOnly: user, group and membership queries, mapping)
- internal/ScimFilters.java (from ScimIdentityProviderReadOnly: criteria to SCIM filter translation)
- internal/ScimHttpClient.java, internal/ScimOAuthTokens.java (from ScimClient: requests, authentication, OAuth2 client credentials)
- internal/ScimTtlCache.java (from ScimSimpleCache)
- internal/ScimUserQuery.java, ScimGroupQuery.java, ScimTenantQuery.java, ScimIdentityProviderFactory.java
